{"3631410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AUTO DERBY CASINO", "steam_appid": 3631410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/63000cb6589018debdfe92711d7684dd.poster.avif?t=1779922850\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/63000cb6589018debdfe92711d7684dd.webm?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/63000cb6589018debdfe92711d7684dd.mp4?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a broken down casino, you and your friends bet on chaotic horse races: without rules.  Juice up the horses, fling them off the track, or even steal your friends' bets. All that matters is that you win: or your rivals lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/d02e43e3723cd1f32b3ca56cd72ad485.poster.avif?t=1779922850\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/d02e43e3723cd1f32b3ca56cd72ad485.webm?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/d02e43e3723cd1f32b3ca56cd72ad485.mp4?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/6ab1bd18e3e080c6c5ff0108e14349c7.poster.avif?t=1779922850\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/6ab1bd18e3e080c6c5ff0108e14349c7.webm?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/6ab1bd18e3e080c6c5ff0108e14349c7.mp4?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your money by choosing what horses to bet on every race. Bet on horses winning, losing, placing, over/under times, and more. Find out what your friends are betting on, and team up for a shared objective. Or steal their bets for yourself. Whatever type of gambler you want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/3bf9b59fec2b8ad412baa49056ecc804.poster.avif?t=1779922850\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/3bf9b59fec2b8ad412baa49056ecc804.webm?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/3bf9b59fec2b8ad412baa49056ecc804.mp4?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/ac57408bd0a957d4f28dd8e1b213a93d.poster.avif?t=1779922850\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/ac57408bd0a957d4f28dd8e1b213a93d.webm?t=1779922850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631410/extras/ac57408